# LAMMPS Input Script for HCP Lattice of Magnesium

units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice bcc 1.633
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box

mass 1 24.035

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

# Output settings
write_data structure.xyz

